# Requirements
# - VSCodeプラグイン REST Client

### シナリオ1 複数拠点 正常系
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/report/cn-karte/create
Authorization: Bearer TEST_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "org_id": "TEP",
    "agreement_category": "01",
    "corporate_number": "2025071400001",
    "fiscal_year": "2025",
    "registration_seq": 1
}

### シナリオ2 単一拠点 正常系
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/report/cn-karte/create
Authorization: Bearer TEST_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "corporate_number": "2025062401003",
    "fiscal_year": "2024",
    "registration_seq": 6
}

### シナリオ2 複数拠点 正常系
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/report/pdf/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "creation_info": {
        "bank_code": "0115",
        "branch_code": "789",
        "corporate_number": "1234567890123",
        "fiscal_year": "2024",
        "registration_seq": "3",
        "current_status": "0"
    }
}


